# Concord frontend preview

After any edit to Concord frontend source, rebuild or restart the Concord Vite preview before handing the work off.

- Clear `php/plugins/zen/act/node_modules/.vite` when a fresh preview is needed.
- Start a fresh server on an available port with:
  `cd php/plugins/zen/act && npx vite --config vite.concord.config.js --host 127.0.0.1 --port <port>`
- Tell the user the exact preview URL to open.
